{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">視后佘詩曼（阿佘）向來工作繁忙，但依然非常重視與家人及朋友相處的時光。近日，她在社交平台上分享了與契仔一齊去玩的合照，展現出與平日螢幕上女強人截然不同的溫柔一面，母愛氾濫的畫面融化了不少網民的心。</span></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"charmaine_sheh_1791097847_4000341076694440434_1819466566.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EdKetLhhXK1791186658.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"charmaine_sheh_1791097847_4000341076694440434_1819466566.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">從曝光的照片可見，阿佘與契仔的感情非常深厚。在其中一張相片中，阿佘完全拋開了視后的偶像包袱，雙手抓著契仔的頭髮，張大嘴巴對著鏡頭做出搞怪的表情；而身前的契仔亦十分配合，開心地吐著舌頭做鬼臉，兩人互動非常惹笑可愛。而在另一張相片中，阿佘從後溫馨地環抱著契仔，兩人緊緊靠在一起並對著鏡頭露出燦爛甜美的笑容，畫面洋溢著滿滿的溫馨感。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"charmaine_sheh_1791097847_4000341080544738402_1819466566.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20262InzAzjJTD1791186658.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"charmaine_sheh_1791097847_4000341080544738402_1819466566.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了拍下可愛的合照，阿佘亦為契仔安排了豐富的活動。從她的社交平台限時動態截圖中可見，她帶了契仔去保齡球場遊玩，Jaco雙腿張開在保齡球道前開心地擺姿勢，顯得活力十足。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">這組溫馨的日常照片，讓大眾看到了佘詩曼私底下親切活潑的一面。不少粉絲看後都大讚阿佘是個滿分的好契媽，更笑言她和契仔的互動充滿童真，絕對是名副其實的「大小孩」！</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.56.06.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026WHfFXOTiQ11791186658.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-10-05 下午12.56.06.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T08:18:51.388386+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":426,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}